{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02285","headline":"杂曲歌辞 十二月乐辞 正月 · 李贺","name":"杂曲歌辞 十二月乐辞 正月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上楼迎春新春归，暗黄着柳宫漏迟。\n薄薄淡霭弄野姿，寒绿幽泥生短丝。\n锦牀晓卧玉肌冷，露脸未开对朝暝。\n官街柳带不堪折，早晚菖蒲胜绾结。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02285.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02285","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}